MTP: sleep until receive, cancellation or disconnect

Preserve the USB-final-02 ring, queued OUT requests, FIFO and storage pipeline.
Publish cancel/stop under the receive mutex so predicate waits cannot miss
a notification. Remove the 20-ms idle timeout.

